{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18644","headline":"柳州城西北隅种柑树 · 柳宗元","name":"柳州城西北隅种柑树","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"手种黄柑二百株，春来新叶徧城隅。\n方同楚客怜皇树，不学荆州利木奴。\n几岁开花闻喷雪，何人摘实见垂珠。\n若教坐待成林日，滋味还堪养老夫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳宗元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18644.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18644","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}